### Hent alle patienter

GET http://localhost:3000/api/patients

### Opret symptomregistrering

POST http://localhost:3000/api/registreringer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patient_id": 1,
  "symptom": "Migræne",
  "severity": 4
}

